 "footer": "<b>Notes:</b> (1) With the switch on there is no Paid column, so Mark paid can’t be pressed. Its toast only matters if the switch is turned on while it shows. Color Belt’s v0.412 closes the toast at that moment, and Camps would copy that, so the drawn words are a safety net. Camps’ other toasts have no amounts. (2) “Total now” keeps its label so staff see that a total exists. The option is to leave the line out entirely, as Color Belt shows no fee in Edit. (3) The Delete camp sentence is new wording (Color Belt’s event version reads “Its N students, … and any recorded payment are deleted too.”). <b>Script:</b> <code>mock-c01-edit-delete-hidden.js</code>."
